  "description": "This Watercolor Garden Harvest PNG Bundle features 38 beautifully hand-painted style illustrations,19 fruits and 19 vegetables, making it the ultimate botanical clipart collection for any creative project!\nThe vegetable collection includes: pumpkin, asparagus, parsley, onion, tomato, artichoke, broccoli, snap peas, garlic, radish, carrots, leek, eggplant, cabbage, bell pepper, and cauliflower plus 3 more garden surprises.\nThe fruit collection includes: blueberries, mango, blackberry, pomegranate, pear, avocado, apple, strawberry, cherries, fig, watermelon, raspberries, kiwi, lemon, dragon fruit, plum, peach, and grapes plus one more juicy surprise.\nEach illustration showcases delicate watercolor textures, vibrant natural colors, and soft artistic shading for a fresh, charming, and organic aesthetic that brings the beauty of nature straight into your designs.\nThis mega bundle is perfect for farmers market designs, kitchen art, food blogs, recipe cards, harvest celebrations, summer parties, and nature-themed projects. With a cohesive botanical style and an incredible variety of both fruits and vegetables, this bundle works beautifully for rustic, modern, and whimsical designs alike.\nPerfect for DIY crafts ✂️, farmers market invitations 🌿, kitchen wall art 🖼️, kids books 📚, greeting cards 💌, food packaging 🍓, scrapbooking 📒, sublimation 🎨, stickers 🏷️, party décor 🎉, social media graphics 📱, planners, journals, POD products, and more.\nAll files are delivered as high-quality PNGs with transparent backgrounds, making them easy to use in Canva, Photoshop, Procreate, Cricut, Silhouette, and other design software. Simply drag, drop, and create.\n✨ Included in this bundle:\n38 high-resolution watercolor PNG images (19 fruits + 19 vegetables)\nTransparent backgrounds\n300 DPI\nInstant digital download\nPlease Note:\nThis is a digital product\nFiles may not be shared, redistributed, or resold as standalone files\nColors may vary slightly depending on screen and printer settings\nAI-assisted tools may have been used during the creative process\nFrom garden to table,painted with love for your most beautiful handmade projects 🌿🍉🥦",
  "fullDescription": "<p>This Watercolor Garden Harvest PNG Bundle features 38 beautifully hand-painted style illustrations,19 fruits and 19 vegetables, making it the ultimate botanical clipart collection for any creative project!</p>\n<p>The vegetable collection includes: pumpkin, asparagus, parsley, onion, tomato, artichoke, broccoli, snap peas, garlic, radish, carrots, leek, eggplant, cabbage, bell pepper, and cauliflower plus 3 more garden surprises.</p>\n<p>The fruit collection includes: blueberries, mango, blackberry, pomegranate, pear, avocado, apple, strawberry, cherries, fig, watermelon, raspberries, kiwi, lemon, dragon fruit, plum, peach, and grapes plus one more juicy surprise.</p>\n<p>Each illustration showcases delicate watercolor textures, vibrant natural colors, and soft artistic shading for a fresh, charming, and organic aesthetic that brings the beauty of nature straight into your designs.</p>\n<p>This mega bundle is perfect for farmers market designs, kitchen art, food blogs, recipe cards, harvest celebrations, summer parties, and nature-themed projects. With a cohesive botanical style and an incredible variety of both fruits and vegetables, this bundle works beautifully for rustic, modern, and whimsical designs alike.</p>\n<p>Perfect for DIY crafts ✂️, farmers market invitations 🌿, kitchen wall art 🖼️, kids books 📚, greeting cards 💌, food packaging 🍓, scrapbooking 📒, sublimation 🎨, stickers 🏷️, party décor 🎉, social media graphics 📱, planners, journals, POD products, and more.</p>\n<p>All files are delivered as high-quality PNGs with transparent backgrounds, making them easy to use in Canva, Photoshop, Procreate, Cricut, Silhouette, and other design software. Simply drag, drop, and create.</p>\n<p>✨ Included in this bundle:<br>\n38 high-resolution watercolor PNG images (19 fruits + 19 vegetables)<br>\nTransparent backgrounds<br>\n300 DPI<br>\nInstant digital download</p>\n<p>Please Note:<br>\nThis is a digital product<br>\nFiles may not be shared, redistributed, or resold as standalone files<br>\nColors may vary slightly depending on screen and printer settings<br>\nAI-assisted tools may have been used during the creative process</p>\n<p>From garden to table,painted with love for your most beautiful handmade projects 🌿🍉🥦</p>",
